===============================================================================
               STRICT SECURITY & DEPLOYMENT PROTOCOLS ANNEX
===============================================================================

1. MANDATORY VULNERABILITY AUDITING PROTOCOL
   All container images built or deployed using this codebase (including 
   ayushman21/vertexlab-status-app) MUST undergo mandatory Aqua Security Trivy
   vulnerability scanning prior to registry push. Any build containing 
   unpatched CRITICAL or HIGH CVEs is strictly prohibited from reaching 
   production Kubernetes clusters.

2. CONTAINER HARDENING & PRIVILEGE RESTRICTIONS
   All workloads deployed via this platform MUST enforce non-root execution 
   (USER appuser / UID 10001). Privileged container execution, host namespace
   sharing, or running processes as root (UID 0) is explicitly restricted.

3. GITOPS CONFIGURATION DRIFT PROTOCOL
   All cluster deployments MUST maintain active Argo CD GitOps controller sync
   with selfHeal: true and prune: true enabled. Manual, un-audited cluster state 
   mutations outside of the Git repository flow are strictly disallowed.

4. TELEMETRY & OBSERVABILITY INTEGRITY
   Applications deployed via DeployMate MUST expose Prometheus metrics endpoints
   (/metrics via prom-client) and maintain Liveness and Readiness probes to
   ensure strict SRE SLA compliance and continuous telemetry visibility.
